WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.418
To begin, launch Copilot CLI.

00:00:06.100 --> 00:00:09.936
Now type /index to manage the code search index.

00:00:11.100 --> 00:00:15.175
Copilot reports the status of the index for this repository.

00:00:16.100 --> 00:00:18.834
Like a book's index for your codebase.
